You fire a shot for [117%, 125%, 130%, 135%, 140% (TL1-5)] damage that attempts to pin your target to the ground for [2, 3, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns, as well as giving your next Steady Shot or Shoot 100% increased chance to critically hit and mark (regardless of whether the pin succeeds).

This shot has a 20% chance to mark the target.

The chance to pin increases with your Accuracy.
